      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">[1] Hansen, E. R.: Global Optimization Using Interval Analysis, Marcel Dekker, Inc., New York, 1992.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">[2] Kearfott, R. B.: Rigorous Global Search: Com- putational Methods, Kluwer, Dordrecht, Netherlands, 1996.</p>
